---
import Sheet from '../layouts/Sheet.astro';
---

<Sheet
  title="Privacy Policy | SkyKPI"
  description="SkyKPI keeps only what you email us, sells no data, and sets no tracking cookies. The full policy, in plain language."
  path="/privacy/"
  sheetName="Privacy"
>
  <section class="section privacy">
    <div class="container privacy__inner">
      <p class="tag">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The short version: when you email us or send the contact form, we receive what you sent and use it to reply. The site sets no tracking cookies.
      </p>

      <div class="privacy__body">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          If you email us or submit the contact form, we receive what you typed: your name, company or association, email address, phone number if you gave one, and message. Our host, Netlify, also keeps standard server logs.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use it to reply to you and to carry on the conversation you
          started. We do not add you to a mailing list, share your
          information, or sell it to anyone.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          This site sets no cookies and runs no tracking or analytics
          scripts. If we ever add analytics, it will be a cookieless,
          server-side kind that does not identify you, and this policy will
          say so before it happens.
        </p>

        <h2>Where your information lives</h2>
        <p>
          Email to us sits in our mailbox like any other correspondence. The site is hosted on Netlify, which processes form submissions and standard server logs on our behalf. Form submissions are forwarded to our email and stored in the Netlify form dashboard.
        </p>

        <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
        <p>
          SkyKPI LLC is an Illinois limited liability company based in Frankfort, Illinois. Any reference to SkyKPI in this policy means SkyKPI LLC.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          If you want a copy of what you sent us, or want it deleted, email{' '}
          <a href="mailto:hello@skykpi.com">hello@skykpi.com</a> and we will
          take care of it.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy__issued meta">Last updated 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Sheet>

<style>
  .privacy {
    padding-top: var(--space-section);
  }

  .privacy__inner {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .privacy__body {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .privacy__body h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .privacy__body a {
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .privacy__issued {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
</style>
